# back. It needs a duck that keeps a map and has a camera: its simulator given a room, as in
# `quackd run find-the-ball --room two-rooms --yes`, where the ball hides in the other room.
---
duck: 1
name: find-the-ball
description: Find the ball in a room you have not seen yet, walk up to it, say where it was, and come back to where you began.
